# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the API image needs.
# This is what keeps the 13 GB simulation archive, HoYoLAB snapshots, .env cookies, validation sets and the
# Windows gcsim binary out of the build context. A new top-level folder is excluded until it is listed here.
*

!api/
!gtc/
!knowledge/
!data/sources/cache/amber/

# never, even inside an allowed folder
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.pkl
knowledge/my_teams.yaml
